e":"If the fire extinguisher does not function properly, it can increase the risk of injury in the event of a fire.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners instructing them to contact Kidde for a replacement fire extinguisher, free of charge.  The recall began February 14, 2018.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403 or Kidde customer service service toll-free at 1-855-262-3540, or online at www.kidde.com and click on \"Product Safety Recall\" for more information. Chrysler's number for this recall is T82.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":61791,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=17V824000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":55,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2004","make":"DODGE","model":"DURANGO"},{"year":"2007","make":"DODGE","model":"CALIBER"},{"year":"2009","make":"DODGE","model":"CHALLENGER"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2012","make":"RAM","model":"1500"},{"year":"2013","make":"RAM","model":"5500"},{"year":"2013","make":"RAM","model":"3500"},{"year":"2013","make":"RAM","model":"2500"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"RAM","model":"4500"},{"year":"2014","make":"RAM","model":"2500"},{"year":"2014","make":"JEEP","model":"CHEROKEE"},{"year":"2014","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2014","make":"RAM","model":"5500"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"JOURNEY"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2015","make":"RAM","model":"5500"},{"year":"2015","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2015","make":"RAM","model":"1500"},{"year":"2014","make":"RAM","model":"3500"},{"year":"2015","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"RAM","model":"4500"},{"year":"2012","make":"RAM","model":"3500"},{"year":"2015","make":"RAM","model":"2500"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true},{"campaign":"14V234000","received":"2014-05-07","manufacturer":"Chrysler Group LLC","component":"ELECTRICAL SYSTEM","summary":"Chrysler Group, LLC (Chrysler) is recalling certain model year 2010-2014 Chrysler Town and Country and Dodge Grand Caravan vehicles manufactured August 25, 2010, through October 31, 2013.  The affected vehicles may experience overheating of the vent window switch in the driver's door armrest.","consequence":"An overheated switch may result in a vehicle fire.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will replace the vent window switch with a newer version, free of charge.  The owner notification letter was issued and the remedy campaign launched on on December 31, 2014.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is P25.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":644757,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=14V234000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":10,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2010","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"16V044000","received":"2016-01-28","manufacturer":"Chrysler (FCA US LLC)","component":"VISIBILITY:WINDSHIELD","summary":"FCA US LLC (Chrysler) is recalling certain model year 2015-2016 Chrysler Town and Country, and 2014-2015 Dodge Grand Caravan vehicles manufactured August 16, 2014, to December 5, 2015.  The windshield on the affected vehicles may have been installed using expired urethane primer, allowing the windshield to become displaced in the event of a crash.  As such, these vehicles fail to comply with the requirements of Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard (FMVSS) number 212, \"Windshield Mounting.\"","consequence":"If the windshield dislodges during a crash, there is an increased risk of occupant injury.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will replace the windshield, free of charge.  The recall began March 4, 2016. Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is S02.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":184,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=16V044000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":4,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2015","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2015","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2016","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"14V632000","received":"2014-10-08","manufacturer":"Chrysler Group LLC","component":"TIRES:PRESSURE MONITORING AND REGULATING SYSTEMS","summary":"Chrysler Group LLC (Chrysler) is recalling certain model year 2014 Chrysler Town and Country and Dodge Grand Caravan vehicles manufactured March 20, 2014, to April 22, 2014, and 2014 Jeep Wrangler vehicles manufactured March 21, 2014, to April 22, 2014.  Due to a software error, the Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) may fail to learn the locations of the individual sensors while the vehicle is being driven.  As a result, the low tire pressure warning light will illuminate, despite the the tire pressures being within specification.  Should one of the tires lose air pressure, the driver would not be notified of the change in air pressure.  As such, these vehicles fail to comply with the requirements of Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard No. 138, \"Tire Pressure Monitoring Systems.\"","consequence":"If the TPMS light illuminates because the sensors cannot be located, it could mask an actual low tire pressure condition, possibly resulting in tire failure, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Chrysler has notified owners, and dealers will reprogram the TPMS module, free of charge.  The recall began on October 23, 2014.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403. Chrysler's number for this recall is P63.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":10390,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=14V632000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":3,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"JEEP","model":"WRANGLER"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"25V876000","received":"2025-12-18","manufacturer":"Rollx Vans","component":"EQUIPMENT ADAPTIVE/MOBILITY:WHEELCHAIR RESTRAINTS/SECUREMENT:LATCH/ANCHOR:","summary":"Rollx Vans (Rollx) is recalling certain GMC Yukon, Sierra, Chevrolet Express 2500, Ford Transit, E-250, Toyota Sienna, Sienna Hybrid, Honda Odyssey, Chrysler Town and Country, Voyager, Pacifica, Dodge Grand Caravan, and Ram Promaster vehicles equipped with QRT-Deluxe and QRT-Max wheelchair restraints. Please refer to Rollx's recall report for specific model year information. The retractors may not lock, preventing the wheelchair from being properly secured.","consequence":"An unsecured wheelchair can move during transit, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Rollx will work with Q'Straint to inspect and replace the retractors as necessary, free of charge. Owner notification letters were mailed February 5, 2026. Owners may contact Rollx's customer service at 1-800-956-6668.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":86,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=25V876000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":52,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2024","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2023","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2024","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2025","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2025","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"YUKON"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"SIERRA 1500"},{"year":"2025","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2021","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2015","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2019","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2019","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2011","make":"FORD","model":"E-250"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true}]}
